    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gamng'awa Dawdi heeda Sawli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Dawdi ng'eanyiida Nobu heeda ashoohoocheanda siguura Ahimeleki, Ng'ata gawa Ahimeleki gwaroonyi Dawdi nea ghaboadan ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan, anda gibea geaw nea miideanani sih?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Dawdi Ahimeleki was ashoohoocheanda, “Aniini geandi hiji aba gadiyeeda sugoocheanda, ak gwayeeshiinean, ‘Gagasa ea mwanala sih ng'asheanji aba badaydeaba siisi eajeakteawaneeyiin, ea iiteaba ng'asheanji earukuneeyiin.’ Ak ea nearukusi gheareemanga gaweay hich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gindeawi naaha? Goonean mukaataji muut, ghana gida wasean indeawi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha ashoohoocheanda ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Aniini meandeawani mukaateeyda gealaan aba geatindeanyu, geandeawi mukaateeyda ghaydit; geaghus ea niheeli geat gheareemanga sea gadeemga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Dawdi ak gwayeesha ashoohoocheanda, “Fugeasu iissa gafur geat ak aamiyaas eara iisiweayi bareanyeeka gealaan, abeeda ea mayghwaraanya muuchi damani dabiteanya iisiweayi bareanyeeka ghaydit?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw ashoohoocheanda niny mukaateeyda ghaydit; aba gideaba hoowa manda mukaate geaghus mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, nea sigeanda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geakghiisa mukaatajeega gareadi aba eaweeda sigeandeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda eaweedida gwanda siyagi aba jeeda fuga gadiyeeda Sawli, ak geateal aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak gheawungaaschi geeguura Doegi bea eemeeda Edomu, was siida haw bea Sawli was jeagiischoodiga nooga Sawli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Ahimeleki, “Gindeawi ng'uta ghana ng'uta goonean? Aba gideaba aniini meayeani ng'uta ghana dabiteanyu bea ng'ucheeda aba gideaba gadiyeeda sugoocheanda gagasa ealamwach.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha ashoohoocheanda, “Geandeawi ng'uta Goliyati was siida Filisti, ghayi ibarsi moangoachiyda Ela, ng'ula gwanda hiji geeneawusa hang'da aba badayda hang'da siikwealiisa hamarjoojiga; iigasayi geanda haleanjeeni gigeandi, aba gideaba hiji manda nuut geaghus nih.” Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha, “Manda dea uurji nih, goonean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Dawdi eaweedida ak gamng'aw aba madeeda Sawli, ak gawa heeda Akishi was sugoocheanda Gati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha fuga gadiyeeda Akishi niny, “Siisi neada ea miy Dawdi was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiidea? Neada ea maba siisi sarmasa nuut nea gwarukusa iitaanyi aba salanga nyaawa nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
